<title>USA: Jay Jacobs chairman retires.</title>
<headline>Jay Jacobs chairman retires.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jay Jacobs Inc said Jay Jacobs, the founder of the company, as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>He will remain on the board as a director.  Paul Buxbaum, president of Buxbaum, Ginsberg &amp; Associates, has been elected to succeed Jacobs as chairman.</p>
<p>&quot;We would like to thank Mr. Jacobs for his many contributions to the company and compliment him on a 55 year history of innovation and success in the retail industry,&quot; said Rex Steffey, president and CEO. &quot;We wish him well in everything.&quot;</p>
</text>
